n style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a3a29e\">⠿ ＋ ⋯</span>hover operation button</span></span>\n    </span>","parts":[{"key":"graybg","cn":"浅灰底","en":"Gray Canvas","desc":"示例使用暖灰画布；具体颜色要与主题和文字对比度一起确定","desc_en":"Example uses a warm gray canvas; specific color will be determined in conjunction with subject matter and text contrast"},{"key":"card","cn":"白色内容区","en":"Page","desc":"文档像一张稿纸放在灰桌上，边界很浅","desc_en":"The document sits on the gray table like a sheet of manuscript paper, with faint borders."},{"key":"emoji","cn":"emoji 图标","en":"Emoji Icon","desc":"可用于页面装饰和轻量分类；关键功能仍要有稳定、可识别的名称","desc_en":"Can be used for page decoration and lightweight classification; key functions should still have stable, recognizable names"},{"key":"ink","cn":"灰黑文字","en":"Ink","desc":"用多级文字颜色建立层级，每一级都要在对应背景上保持可读","desc_en":"Create a hierarchy with multiple levels of text colors, each level remaining readable against the corresponding background"},{"key":"divider","cn":"细分割线","en":"Divider","desc":"示例用 1px 细线分段；边界强度按内容复杂度调整","desc_en":"Example segmented with 1px thin lines; border strength adjusted according to content complexity"},{"key":"hover","cn":"按需操作钮","en":"Context Actions","desc":"鼠标悬停、键盘聚焦时出现，触屏上则提供明确点击入口","desc_en":"It appears when the mouse is hovering or the keyboard is focused, and a clear click entry is provided on the touch screen."}]},"use":[{"t":"文档、笔记和知识库，以编辑与阅读为主","m":"style-notion-use-doc"},{"t":"团队协作工具，需要统一任务、评论和多人内容","m":"style-notion-use-team"},{"t":"个人知识库，用侧栏和页面树组织层级","m":"style-notion-use-wiki"},{"t":"数据有多种视图，但希望界面保持轻量","m":"style-notion-use-db"}],"dont":[{"t":"营销页只剩灰白骨架，缺少利益点和行动入口","m":"style-notion-dont-landing","bad":true},{"t":"电商页面忽略图片、价格、规格和购买信息","m":"style-notion-dont-shop","bad":true},{"t":"重要操作只在 hover 时出现，触屏无法发现","m":"style-notion-dont-mobile","bad":true},{"t":"机械限制所有页面只能使用灰、白、黑","m":"style-notion-dont-brand","bad":true}],"principles":[{"t":"<b>内容即界面</b>：编辑器就是产品本身，去掉一切多余的壳和装饰","m":"style-notion-content"},{"t":"<b>emoji 可以做轻量页面图标</b>：容易理解且有个性，但不同系统外观会变化，正式功能仍需稳定图标和文字","m":"style-notion-emoji"},{"t":"<b>次要操作按需出现</b>：鼠标悬停、键盘聚焦和触屏点击都要能找到同一入口","m":"style-notion-hover"},{"t":"<b>以灰阶建立文字层级</b>：标题、正文和注释可以降低强调，但关键信息与状态仍可使用有含义的颜色","m":"style-notion-hier"},{"t":"<b>细分割线配合留白分区</b>：边界要足够清楚，复杂表格或输入控件可以使用更明确的边框","m":"style-notion-divider"}],"prompt":"做一个团队项目文档界面，方便成员阅读计划、查看任务并新建内容。用清楚的侧边栏、页面层级和轻量分区组织信息；次要操作可以按需显示，但鼠标、键盘和触屏用户都要能找到。","prompt_en":"Document-style productivity interface, light gray canvas with a white page, emoji icons, muted text hierarchy, 1px dividers, compact spacing, contextual actions revealed on hover","scenes":["Notion 式文档页","侧边栏工作区","看板数据库视图","团队 Wiki 首页"],"en":{"prompt":"Document-style productivity interface, light gray canvas with a white page, emoji icons, muted text hierarchy, 1px dividers, compact spacing, contextual actions revealed on hover","use":[{"t":"Knowledge base","m":"style-notion-use-doc"},{"t":"Writing and project tools","m":"style-notion-use-team"},{"t":"Internal documentation","m":"style-notion-use-wiki"},{"t":"Products organized around editable blocks","m":"style-notion-use-db"}],"dont":[{"t":"Copy slash commands into a product that does not need blocks","m":"style-notion-dont-landing","bad":true},{"t":"Use gray text with insufficient contrast","m":"style-notion-dont-shop","bad":true},{"t":"Hide important actions until an exact hover target is found","m":"style-notion-dont-mobile","bad":true},{"t":"Make every page look like a document when tasks need richer controls","m":"style-notion-dont-brand","bad":true}],"principles":[{"t":"Treat content blocks as the main structure","m":"style-notion-content"},{"t":"Keep typography compact and readable","m":"style-notion-emoji"},{"t":"Use neutral surfaces with small, meaningful accents","m":"style-notion-hover"},{"t":"Reveal controls near the content they affect","m":"style-notion-hier"},{"t":"Support scanning through indentation, icons, and consistent spacing","m":"style-notion-divider"}],"scenes":["Knowledge base","Project document","Team wiki","Content editor"],"sceneUI":["<div style=\"max-width:620px;margin:0 auto;background:#fff;border:1px solid #ececea;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden\">\n      <img src=\"/assets/cover-workspace.png\" style=\"width:100%;height:96px;object-fit:cover;display:block\" alt=\"\">\n      <div style=\"padding:0 48px 20px\">\n        <span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:38px;margin-top:-20px;background:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:2px 4px\">📚</span>\n        <div style=\"font-size:26px;font-weight:700;color:#37352f\">Product Team Handbook</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#6b6a67;margin:4px 0 10px\">👥 8 members · Updated 2 hours ago</div>\n        <div style=\"background:#f7f7f5;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 14px;font-size:13px;color:#37352f\">💡 This manual answers three things: who we are, how we make decisions, and where to find information. </div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#37352f;margin:16px 0 6px\">This week’s highlights</div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:13px;color:#37352f;padding:4px 0\"><span style=\"width:14px;height:14px;border:1.5px solid #c9c8c4;border-radius:3px;background:#37352f;border-color:#37352f;color:#fff;font-size:12px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">✓</span>v2.0 release review</div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:13px;color:#37352f;padding:4px 0\"><span style=\"width:14px;height:14px;border:1.5px solid #c9c8c4;border-radius:3px\"></span>New employee onboarding document update</div>\n        <div style=\"border-top:1px solid #f1f1ef;margin:12px 0\"></div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#37352f;line-height:1.9\">• Design review every Wednesday afternoon<br>• Write \"why\" first in the requirements document</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:620px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;background:#fff;border:1px solid #ececea;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden\">\n      <di