>","<div style=\"max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;background:#fff;border:1px solid #ececea;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f1ef\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#37352f\">📋 Launch task board</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#6b6a67;border:1px solid #ececea;border-radius:5px;padding:2px 8px\">Board ⌄</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fbfbfa\">\n        <div style=\"flex:1\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#6b6a67;padding:0 2px 8px\">Not started · 2</div>\n          <div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #ececea;border-radius:8px;padding:9px 10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04)\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#37352f\">Launch presentation</div><span style=\"display:inline-block;margin-top:6px;background:#f1f1ef;color:#73716c;font-size:12px;border-radius:4px;padding:1px 7px\">Design</span></div>\n          <div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #ececea;border-radius:8px;padding:9px 10px;margin-top:8px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04)\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#37352f\">Media outreach list</div><span style=\"display:inline-block;margin-top:6px;background:#fdecc8;color:#9a6b1a;font-size:12px;border-radius:4px;padding:1px 7px\">Operations</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"flex:1\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#6b6a67;padding:0 2px 8px\">In progress · 2</div>\n          <div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #ececea;border-radius:8px;padding:9px 10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04)\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#37352f\">Build website landing page</div><span style=\"display:inline-block;margin-top:6px;background:#d3e5ef;color:#1a5c8a;font-size:12px;border-radius:4px;padding:1px 7px\">Front-end</span></div>\n          <div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #ececea;border-radius:8px;padding:9px 10px;margin-top:8px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04)\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#37352f\">Finalize pricing plans</div><span style=\"display:inline-block;margin-top:6px;background:#dbeddb;color:#2a5d31;font-size:12px;border-radius:4px;padding:1px 7px\">Product</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"flex:1\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#6b6a67;padding:0 2px 8px\">Done · 1</div>\n          <div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #ececea;border-radius:8px;padding:9px 10px;opacity:.65\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#37352f;text-decoration:line-through\">Confirm launch date</div><span style=\"display:inline-block;margin-top:6px;background:#dbeddb;color:#2a5d31;font-size:12px;border-radius:4px;padding:1px 7px\">✓ Done</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:620px;margin:0 auto;background:#fff;border:1px solid #ececea;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;padding:24px 40px\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:34px\">🏠</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:700;color:#37352f;margin-top:6px\">Xiaoli’s knowledge base</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#6b6a67;margin:4px 0 14px\">Today is also an organized day. </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#6b6a67;padding-bottom:6px\">Latest updates</div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:7px 0;border-top:1px solid #f1f1ef;font-size:13px;color:#37352f\">🚀 New product release plan<span style=\"margin-left:auto;font-size:12px;color:#6b6a67\">2 hours ago</span></div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:7px;color:#6b6a67\">Yesterday</span></div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:7px;color:#6b6a67\">3 days ago</span></div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:7px 0;border-top:1px solid #f1f1ef;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f1ef;font-size:13px;color:#37352f\">✈️ Travel List<span style=\"margin-left:auto;font-size:12px;color:#6b6a67\">Last week</span></div>\n    </div>"]},"usageMocks":{"style-notion-use-doc":"<div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">📖 团队手册</span><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:82%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">适合以文档阅读和编辑为主要任务的界面</span>","style-notion-use-team":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#e8b4b4\"></span><span style=\"width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#b4cfe8;margin-left:-8px\"></span><span style=\"width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#c8e8b4;margin-left:-8px\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">3 人正在编辑</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">多人协作的工具感界面</span>","style-notion-use-wiki":"<div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">🏠 我的主页</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#73716c\">📅 周计划　🎯 目标　💡 灵感</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">适合个人知识库与信息整理页面</span>","style-notion-use-db":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"mk-tag gray\">表格</span><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">看板</span><span class=\"mk-tag gray\">日历</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">同一份数据可按任务切换不同视图</span>","style-notion-dont-landing":"<div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#37352f\">新品活动页（文档风）</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">营销页通常还需要更明确的品牌与商品表达</span></div>","style-notion-dont-shop":"<div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">商品详情：白底、细线、小灰字</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">电商页面还需呈现商品特征与购买信息</span></div>","style-notion-dont-mobile":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"width:34px;height:56px;border:1.5px solid #c9c8c4;border-radius:6px\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">触屏无法依赖稳定悬停</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">移动端需提供可发现的点击入口</span>","style-notion-dont-brand":"<div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#37352f\">品牌活动页（灰白配色）</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">需要强品牌色时，应补充相应的视觉表达</span></div>"}}}